  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There seem to be some regressions around head and neck movement with 6-point tracking, on both SDK2 and SDK3 avatars.\nI've put some reference images here: https://www.dropbox.com/sh/lfiwsd2pu240iu7/AAAgRo83-jcYtANRXcOrw8zua?dl=0\n1. Neck movement seems unnatural when tilting your head. In particular, the chest->neck angle seems to become quite extreme and looks unnatural.\n2. The head gets pushed back a bit after calibration, resulting in a strange, tilted-back posture. I have less reference photos of this but I'll collect some more tomorrow (I did post the one picture I had of myself doing a t-pose in reality showing the head pushed back a bit far).",
